"32831,32707,7\" title=\"Ver no mapa\">here (32831, 32707, 7)</a> and <a class=\"coord-link\" data-coord=\"32854,32745,7\" title=\"Ver no mapa\">here (32854, 32745, 7)</a>.\n</p>\n</div>\n<div id=\"w-creature-behaviour\">\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Behaviour\">Behaviour</span></h3>\n<p>\tIt will hit you with melee and if you try to tame it, it may dissapear (run away). They will kill weaker creatures to reach you. The panther is a quick creature.<br/><br/>A midnight panther attacks in melee range. A midnight panther will retreat at 48 to 359 (4% - 29.92%, red) health.\n</p>\n</div>\n<p><br/>\n</p>\n<div style=\"clear:both;\"></div>\n<div>\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Loot\">Loot</span></h3>\n<p><small><i>Drop rates are estimated based on 37 samples <span class=\"loot-stats-link\">(Loot Statistics)</span>.</i></small> <small><i>Colour-coding is applied after 500 samples — current sample size is below this threshold.</i></small><br/><small><i>Task column indicates items used in delivery tasks.</i></small>\n</p>\n<table class=\"wikitable sortable\" style=\"text-align:center; width:auto;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<th></th>\n<th>Item</th>\n<th>Task</th>\n<th>Quantity</th>\n<th>Avg</th>\n<th data-sort-type=\"number\">%\n</th></tr>\n<tr>\n<td><span class=\"loot-table-icon\"><span class=\"no-pseudoelements-container\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><img alt=\"Panther Paw\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"32\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Panther_Paw_5b9c5d.gif\" width=\"32\"/></span></span></span></td>\n<td>Panther Paw</td>\n<td></td>\n<td>1</td>\n<td>1.0</td>\n<td class=\"\" data-sort-value=\"100.000000\" style=\"text-align:center;\">100%\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td><span class=\"loot-table-icon\"><span class=\"no-pseudoelements-container\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"#/wiki/Gold%20Coin\"><img alt=\"Gold Coin\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"32\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Gold_Coin_a5b511.